&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Snorkel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Snorkel AI is the frontier AI data lab, helping teams build the data and environments behind high-performing frontier and agentic AI. We combine technology with research-driven AI data development to create datasets, benchmarks, evals, and custom solutions for real-world AI systems. Founded out of the Stanford AI Lab in 2019, Snorkel works with leading AI labs and enterprises to move from better data to better outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Excited to help us redefine how AI is built? Apply to be the newest Snorkeler!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Director, GTM Systems &amp;amp; AI Transformation&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to:&lt;/strong&gt; VP, Revenue Operations &lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Senior GTM Transformation Specialist, Senior GTM Engineer &lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; San Francisco&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Snorkel AI&#39;s Revenue Operations team designs, builds, and runs the systems, data, and processes that power our Go-to-Market motion. The Director, GTM Systems &amp;amp; AI Transformation leads that effort end-to-end — from systems architecture to workflow automation to AI-enabled process innovation — and manages a small, high-leverage systems team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on leadership role for someone who can own the technical roadmap and transform the GTM motion. You&#39;ll partner directly with Sales, Delivery, Marketing, Finance, and Legal to make sure our systems reflect how the business actually needs to run, and you&#39;ll be a trusted business partner to every team you touch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Own&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems Strategy &amp;amp; Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with GTM leaders to define and evolve the systems architecture strategy across Sales, Delivery, Customer Success, Marketing, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the roadmap for Salesforce and the broader GTM stack (Gong, Clay, Ironclad, Float, CPQ, billing/revenue automation, and future tooling)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Salesforce architecture, data integrity, and data hygiene as the foundation of the role — new automation and AI initiatives get built on top of a clean, well-governed baseline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own vendor relationships and renewals across the GTM stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and grow the team, setting priorities and reviewing technical design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn ambiguous business requests from Sales, Delivery, and Finance into scoped, shippable system changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish an intake, prioritization, and release process so the team moves from reactive to proactive and keeps stakeholders informed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Governance &amp;amp; Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and enforce data hygiene standards and field/object governance across the CRM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the orchestration and reliability of revenue data across the GTM ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with systems and data operations teams to ensure data quality, governance, and visibility across core GTM platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help architecture lead-to-cash processes — handoffs, approvals, escalation paths across Sales, Delivery, and Finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Enablement to roll out new features and ensure technology adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation &amp;amp; AI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead AI transformation across GTM by identifying workflow automation and AI-enabled opportunities across the GTM funnel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement high-impact AI use cases across the GTM lifecycle, including pipeline management, prospecting intelligence, forecasting signals, and customer insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and evolve standardized end-to-end GTM processes that streamline execution through automation, integrations between systems, and the use of AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in Revenue/Sales/GTM Operations, Business Systems, or CRM architecture, including 3+ years leading and developing high-performing technical teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep, architecture-level Salesforce expertise (object model design, automation, integrations); certifications a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning a GTM tool stack beyond Salesforce (forecasting tools, CLM, data enrichment, billing systems)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience developing with AI tools, scaling AI-based solutions, and managing modern technology stacks, combined with the operational pragmatism to know when and how to deploy them effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong prioritization and project management skills in fast-moving environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication and collaboration skills with executives, sales managers, sales reps, cross-departmental leaders, and IT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating in a fast-moving, ambiguous environment — startup or high-growth company experience strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong systems thinking and ability to design durable, scalable solutions instead of one-off fixes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep comprehension of the business motions across Marketing, Sales, and Delivery, and the judgment to know where technology and AI can move the needle for each&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is hybrid schedule for 3 days a week in our Downtown SF office.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Actual compensation will be determined based on factors including skills, qualifications, experience, and geographic location.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary range(s) for this role&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$225,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$290,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be Your Best at Snorkel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
